    misconceptions: ['Deaf-blindness does not always mean no usable vision or hearing.', 'Providing only hearing or only vision support may miss combined access needs.', 'A communication difference is not evidence of low understanding.'], related: ['guided-notes', 'task-chunking', 'accommodation-checklist'], sldLinks: []
