    strategies: ['Teach a small number of clear steps with modeling and guided practice.', 'Use concrete materials, then images, then symbols.', 'Provide repeated practice with feedback and planned review.', 'Check generalization in a new classroom or example.', 'Use age-respectful texts and authentic participation opportunities.', 'Coordinate goals, prompts, and any curriculum modifications with the IEP team.'],
